@startuml board-setup-activity
' board-setup — Activity diagram
' Source procedure: coordination/template/process/board-setup.md
title board-setup — instantiate the coordination pattern

start
:Run board-setup procedure\n(any tool: Claude Code / OpenCode / Codex);

:Step 0 — verify preconditions\n(repo, plan/, explorations/, token scope,\nduplicate board, existing conventions);

if (All preconditions pass?) then (no)
  :Ask the human immediately;
  stop
else (yes)
endif

:Ask up-front questions in one batch\n(board title, stakeholders without GitHub,\ndevelopers, commit flow);

:Step 1 — ingest plan/ and explorations/\n(read md, txt, PDFs, images visually;\nconvert docx/pptx when possible);

if (Unreadable files remain?) then (yes)
  :List them and request exports\nbefore drafting;
  stop
else (no)
endif

:Step 2 — draft IMPLEMENTATION-PLAN.md,\nHUMAN-REVIEW-QUEUE.md, PROCESS.md;

:CHECKPOINT — present drafts and wait;

if (Human approves the plan?) then (no)
  :Revise drafts;
else (yes)
endif

:Step 3 — create project\n(capture number, ID and url);
:Read Status field ID;

:Replace Status options FIRST\nUnshaped, Todo, Agent working,\nAwaiting code review,\nAwaiting human action, Done;
note right
  Options come before any item is added.
  Editing options later regenerates all
  option IDs and silently clears every
  item Status.
end note

:Create Responsible field\n(AI agent, developers, stakeholders, Copilot);
:Create repo labels\n(human-review, agent-work, stakeholder);
:Record every field and option ID;

:Step 4 — seed board from confirmed plan\n(Unshaped drafts, Todo issues, gates, optional Done);
:Verify counts with the totalCount guard\n(truncation is silent);

:Step 5 — emit ALL conventions unconditionally\n(AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md, process/ files, 6 wrappers);

:Verify no leftover setup tokens remain\n(grep by exact token name AND for the\nsource project's board number and owner);

:Commit per the chosen flow\n(PR with review, or direct);

:Step 6 — hand the human their checklist\n(board view, workflows, access, gh auth refresh);

:Output shape — docs written, board URL,\nper-column seed counts, checklist;
stop
@enduml
